ype":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"lib/analysis/\n├── crash_mcp_bridge.dart              # [已有] MCP HTTP 客户端 (需扩展)\n├── crash_local_deep_analyzer.dart     # [新增] 本地深度采证编排器\n├── crash_local_rule_engine.dart       # [新增] 本地规则引擎\n├── crash_local_analysis_result.dart   # [新增] 本地分析结果数据模型\n└── ...\n\nconfig/\n├── app_config.json                    # [已有] MCP 服务地址等\n├── wxwork_dlls.json                   # [已有] 企微官方模块白名单 (302个)\n├── third_party_dlls.json              # [已有] 已知第三方模块名册 (20个厂商)\n├── transparent_modules.json           # [新增] 系统透明模块列表\n└── scene_associations.json            # [新增] 场景关联规则配置\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-67prh4j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-67prh4j","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2 时序图"}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-5gzxe1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-5gzxe1c","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B2 预筛完成后，本地深度分析直接复用预筛产出的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"sessionId"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，跳过上传和建会话步骤。"}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-ftqmmb8","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-ftqmmb8","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant UI as Flutter UI\n    participant Mgr as CrashAnalysisManager\n    participant Bridge as CrashMcpBridge\n    participant MCP as CDB MCP Server\n    participant Analyzer as LocalDeepAnalyzer\n    participant Engine as LocalRuleEngine\n\n    Note over UI,Mgr: 前置: B2 预筛已完成, 拿到 PrefilteredCrashDump 列表\n    UI-\u003e\u003eMgr: startLocalAnalyze(prefilteredList)\n    Note over Mgr: 直接复用 sessionId + dumpSha1\u003cbr/\u003e跳过 upload + createSession (省 5-10s)\n    \n    Note over Mgr,Analyzer: 进入深度采证阶段\n    Mgr-\u003e\u003eAnalyzer: runDeepCollection(sessionId, quickTriageRaw)\n    Analyzer-\u003e\u003eBridge: execDeepCommands(sessionId, commands, presets)\n    Bridge-\u003e\u003eMCP: POST /api/sessions/{id}/exec\n    Note over Bridge,MCP: presets: [exception_info, module_list]\u003cbr/\u003ecommands: [\".ecxr\", \"kb\", \"!analyze -v\"]\n    MCP--\u003e\u003eBridge: {preset_results, command_outputs}\n    Bridge--\u003e\u003eAnalyzer: DeepCollectionResult\n    \n    Note over Mgr,Engine: 进入规则引擎归因阶段\n    Mgr-\u003e\u003eEngine: analyze(collectionResult)\n    Note over Engine: S0: 前置检查\u003cbr/\u003eS1: exception_code 分流\u003cbr/\u003eS2: 定位栈顶用户帧\u003cbr/\u003eS3: 三步归因\u003cbr/\u003eS4: 场景关联\u003cbr/\u003eS5: 补充证据\n    Engine--\u003e\u003eMgr: LocalAnalysisResult\n    \n    Mgr-\u003e\u003eBridge: closeSession(sessionId)\n    Bridge-\u003e\u003eMCP: DELETE /api/sessions/{id}\n    Mgr--\u003e\u003eUI: notify(done, localResult)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-xtnabl2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-xtnabl2","updated":"20260703211211"}},{"ID":"20260703211211-sc1ssen","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-sc1ssen","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. CrashMcpBridge 扩展"}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-zaaxbuh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-zaaxbuh","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.1 新增方法: "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"execDeepCommands"}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-gqv8dsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-gqv8dsi","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CrashMcpBridge"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 只暴露了 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"execQuickTriage"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（仅跑 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"quick_triage"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" preset）。需要新增一个通用的深度命令执行方法。"}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-rtcndl8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-rtcndl8","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.1.1 接口定义"}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-c7pm56j","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-c7pm56j","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/// 深度命令执行结果。\nclass DeepExecResult {\n  /// preset 执行结果列表（结构化 JSON）。\n  final List\u003cMap\u003cString, dynamic\u003e\u003e presetResults;\n  /// 原始 CDB 命令输出列表（按 commands 顺序对应）。\n  final List\u003cString\u003e commandOutputs;\n  \n  const DeepExecResult({\n    required this.presetResults,\n    required this.commandOutputs,\n  });\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-xyp2qkj","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-xyp2qkj","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/// 在已有会话上执行任意 CDB 命令 + presets（本地深度分析专用）。\n///\n/// [sessionId] 来自 createSession；\n/// [commands] 原始 CDB 命令列表，如 [\".ecxr\", \"kb\", \"lm\"]；\n/// [presets] 预定义分析 preset，如 [\"exception_info\", \"module_list\"]；\n/// [timeout] 单命令超时秒数，默认 120s（!analyze -v 可能较慢）。\n///\n/// 抛出 [CrashMcpBridgeException] stage='session_exec_deep'。\nFuture\u003cDeepExecResult\u003e execDeepCommands({\n  required String sessionId,\n  List\u003cString\u003e? commands,\n  List\u003cString\u003e? presets,\n  int timeout = 120,\n}) async { ... }\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-rppcypm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-rppcypm","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.1.2 重试策略"}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-01bio67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-01bio67","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与现有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"execQuickTriage"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 一致：对 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"{403, 408, 429, 502, 503, 504}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 做有限重试（最多 3 次），其他状态码不重试。"}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-joyrmaj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-joyrmaj","updated":"20260703211211"}},{"ID":"20260703211211-9g5l7pz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260703211211-9g5l7pz","updated":"20260703211211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 本地深度采证编排器 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CrashLocalDeepAnalyzer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]},{"ID":"20260703211211-5yglwmn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLeve